{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1169"},"reason":"Body said the second Ten of Hearts played beats the first 'in the standard rules of the German Doppelkopf Federation'; the federation's Turnierspielregeln (5.3.3) say the first of two identical cards wins, explicitly including the Ten of Hearts — the second-beats-first rule is a common house variant. Also the marriage sentence: under the federation rules the partner is the first other player to win a trick within the first three tricks (Klärungsstich, trump or not); 'first non-trump trick' is a house rule. Both sentences fixed in EN/DE/RU.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://doko-verband.de/shared-files/11534/?Turnierspielregeln-Stand-2026-02-21.pdf"},{"url":"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doppelkopf"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",288],["-","the"],["+","as"],["=",1],["-","winner"],["+","their"],["=",1],["-","of"],["+","partner"],["=",5],["-","non-trump"],["+","other"],["=",1],["+","player to win a "],["=",2],["-","as"],["+","(in"],["=",1],["-","their"],["+","many"],["=",1],["-","partner."],["+","home rounds only a non-trump trick counts)."],["=",95],["-","second"],["+","first"],["=",9],["-","first."],["+","second"],["=",1],["+","under the federation rules (many home rounds play it the other way round). "],["=",643]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",256],["-","Gewinner"],["+","ersten"],["=",1],["-","des"],["+","Mitspieler,"],["=",1],["-","ersten"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","Fehlstichs"],["+","einen"],["=",1],["+","Stich macht, "],["=",4],["-","nehmen."],["+","nehmen (in vielen privaten Runden zählt nur ein Fehlstich)."],["=",79],["+","nach den Verbandsregeln "],["=",2],["-","zweite"],["+","zuerst"],["=",5],["-","erste"],["+","zweite"],["=",1],["-","sticht."],["+","sticht"],["=",1],["+","(in vielen privaten Runden gilt es umgekehrt). "],["=",565]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",258],["-","того,"],["+","первого"],["=",1],["-","кто"],["+","дру